flowchart TB
  in[Request] --> route[routeOf: __route or path]
  route --> method[methodGuard]
  method --> origin[assertSameOrigin on writes]
  origin --> body[readJson with a size cap]
  body --> handler[the route's handler]
  handler -->|ok| json[JSON + cache preset]
  handler -->|HttpError| envelope["error: code, message, fields"]
  handler -->|anything else| e500[500 SERVER_ERROR]
